| BR1 diode junction temperature at 8 A DC on the 15 cm2 pours (C): limit = the STPS20M100S absolute maximum 150 C (informational; 110 C would need ~30 cm2 per diode, so the F114 rating is a short-term bound) (`tj_18c`) | 124.1 | 0 … 150 | PASS |
